OL,3,GNEWSAChurch urged to remove netting
OL,4,Aafter bird death
OL,5,
OL,6,FCalls have been made for protective
OL,7,Fnetting to be removed from a church
OL,8,Fafter a dead pigeon was found hanging
OL,9,Ffrom it.
OL,11,FAll Saints' Parish Church in High
OL,12,FWycombe, Buckinghamshire, says the
OL,13,Fnetting protects pedestrians from
OL,14,Ffalling masonry during structural
OL,15,Frepairs and cannot be removed
OL,16,Fimmediately.
OL,18,FAnna Cooke discovered the pigeon while
OL,19,Fsearching for another bird which two
OL,20,Fpeople said had string attached to its
OL,21,Ffeet.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
