OL,3,GNEWSAChurch urged to remove netting
OL,4,Aafter bird death
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe explained: "I saw this dead bird
OL,7,Fhanging in this netting, and I was just
OL,8,Fabsolutely horrified. I just wanted it
OL,9,Fto be urgently fixed because obviously
OL,10,Fit's then a risk to other wildlife."
